OL,3,AEx-White House teleprompter operator
OL,4,Aordered to pay $172,000 for Trump
OL,5,Aspeech bets
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former White House teleprompter
OL,8,Foperator has been ordered to pay more
OL,9,Fthan $172,000 (#127,000) for using
OL,10,Finside information to bet on Donald
OL,11,FTrump's speeches.
OL,13,FGabriel Perez was found to have made
OL,14,Ftrades concerning what the US president
OL,15,Fwould say during addresses between
OL,16,FDecember 2025 and February 2026 on
OL,17,FKalshi - a prediction markets platform
OL,18,Fwhere users can bet on real-world
OL,19,Fevents.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
