OL,3,AEx-White House teleprompter operator
OL,4,Aordered to pay $172,000 for Trump
OL,5,Aspeech bets
OL,6,
OL,7,FIts regulator, the Commodity Futures
OL,8,FTrading Commission (CFTC), said Perez
OL,9,Fwould have to surrender profits of
OL,10,F$107,539.02 and pay a civil penalty of
OL,11,F$65,000.
OL,13,FThe White House has not yet commented.
OL,14,FIn July, then-press secretary Karoline
OL,15,FLeavitt said Perez was on unpaid leave
OL,16,Fand would not return to his post.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
